luid d-block mx-auto mb-3" width=3D"120" height=3D"120">
                    <h3>Create</h3>
                    <div class=3D"code-box">
                        <p>db.collection(=E2=80=98users=E2=80=99).insertOne=
({ name: =E2=80=98Alice=E2=80=99, age: 30 }, (err, result) =3D&gt; {</p>
                        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (err) throw err;</p>
