                    <h3>Delete</h3>
                   <div class=3D"code-box">
                        <p>db.collection(=E2=80=98users=E2=80=99).deleteOne=
({ name: =E2=80=98Alice=E2=80=99 }, (err, result) =3D&gt; {</p>
                        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;if (err) throw err;</p>
                        <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;console.log(=E2=80=98User deleted:=
